===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|programming}} A value, as opposed to an [[identifier]], written into the [[source code]] of a computer program.
# {{context|logic}} A [[propositional calculus|propositional]] [[variable]] or the [[negation]] of a propositional variable.<sup>[http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Resolution_%28logic%29]</sup>

